      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is necessary here - seems like the arm ff-a driver was lacking an `ffa_rx_release` after issuing the `ffa_get_partition` call. For context : https://lore.kernel.org/all/20250401-innocent-outrageous-deer-0946c5@sudeepholla/",
