      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T15:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have the referenced patch [1] from Sudeep applied. I re-tested without this CL to confirm that the problem it is intended to fix reappears. It does indeed:\n\n```\nstatus_t arm_ffa_partition_info_get_desc(uuid_t, size_t, struct ffa_part_info_desc *, size_t *):1638: Call to PARTITION_INFO_GET failed, err \u003d -33\n```\n\n[1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/20250321115700.3525197-1-sudeep.holla@arm.com/",
      "parentUuid": "edc2ec62_ad8aaf59",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1147,
        "startChar": 1,
